video on YouTube and TikTok, which may show platform advertising. Each picture<br>
would carry the credit line you specify, with a link to the museum. Web<br>
resolution is enough.<br>
<br>
If there is a fee or a form I should use instead, please let me know.<br>
<br>
Thank you for your help, and for keeping the story of the murals in front of<br>
visitors.<br>
